hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1","It is narrated from Hazrat Uqbah bin Aamir (may Allah be pleased with him) that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""Allah Almighty has mercy on those who stand guard (the Mujahideen who protect the Muslims)."""
"2","Hazrat Uqbah bin Amir (may Allah be pleased with him) narrates that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings be upon him) said: ""May Allah have mercy on those who stand guard as protectors."""
